@startuml
title Infrastructure / Support — architecture overview

top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #65717D
skinparam ClassBorderColor #65717D
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam PackageBorderColor #65717D
hide empty members

legend top right
  Diagram owner: Nikita
  One box = a group of related classes; members are intentionally omitted.
  <color:#C0392B>red dashed</color> = dependency between owned clusters
  <color:#D97706>orange</color> = two-way coupling with another project layer
  gray dashed = ordinary dependency on another project layer
endlegend

package "External project layers" <<External>> as External #F4F4F4 {
  class "API data contracts" as ApiDataContracts <<external layer>> {
    request models
    response models
    BuildState / BuildStatus
  }

  class "API / UI orchestration" as ApiOrchestration <<external layer>> {
    ApiManager
    BaseSteps / AdminSteps / DatabaseSteps
    RequestSpecs / API and UI clients
  }

  class "Tests & fixtures" as TestConsumers <<external layer>>
}

package "Test Data Generation" <<Layer>> as TestData #ECF8EA {
  class "Model data generation" as ModelDataGeneration <<class group>> {
    GeneratingRule
    RandomModelGenerator
    RandomData
  }

  class "Scenario data" as ScenarioData <<class group>> {
    BuildRunScenario
    CancellableBuildRunScenario
    BuildRunData
    --
    build_step_data
  }
}

package "Model Verification" <<Layer>> as Verification #FFF5D9 {
  class "Assertion API" as AssertionApi <<class group>> {
    ModelAssertions
    EntityAssertions
  }

  class "Comparison engine" as ComparisonCore <<class group>> {
    ModelComparator
    ComparisonResult
    Mismatch
  }

  class "Comparison rules" as ComparisonRules <<class group>> {
    ModelComparisonConfigLoader
    ComparisonRule
    CaseSensitiveConfigParser
    --
    model-comparison.properties
  }
}

package "Test Lifecycle Support" <<Layer>> as Lifecycle #FCEBDD {
  class "Object lifecycle" as LifecycleSupport <<class group>> {
    CreatedObjectsRegistry
    CleanupFailure
    --
    cleanup_objects()
  }
}

package "Database Infrastructure" <<Layer>> as Infrastructure #EAF4FF {
  class "Clients & factory" as DatabaseClients <<class group>> {
    DatabaseClient
    TeamCityBackupDatabaseClient
    PostgreSQLDatabaseClient
    --
    create_database_client()
  }

  class "Executors" as DatabaseExecutors <<class group>> {
    DBExecutor
    TeamCityBackupExecutor
    PostgreSQLExecutor
  }

  class "Query & DAO contracts" as DatabaseContracts <<class group>> {
    DBRequest
    ProjectDao
    BuildConfigurationDao
    UserDao
  }
}

package "Cross-cutting Support" <<Layer>> as CrossCutting #F1EFF8 {
  class "Runtime configuration" as RuntimeConfiguration <<class group>> {
    Config
    TimeoutConfig
  }

  class "TeamCity conventions" as TeamCityMetadata <<class group>> {
    TeamCityLocator
    --
    BUILD_CANCELLATION_COMMENT
    BUILD_RUNTIME_PARAMETER_NAME
    ROOT_PROJECT_ID
  }

  class "Allure metadata" as AllureMetadata <<class group>> {
    AllureTag
    --
    allure_tags()
    api_regression_tags()
  }
}

' Main relations inside owned clusters
DatabaseClients --> DatabaseExecutors : creates / yields
DatabaseExecutors --> DatabaseContracts : executes DBRequest
AssertionApi --> ComparisonCore : compares
AssertionApi --> ComparisonRules : loads mapping

' Dependencies between owned clusters
DatabaseClients ..[#C0392B,dashed]> RuntimeConfiguration : settings / timeouts
ScenarioData ..[#C0392B,dashed]> TeamCityMetadata : shared constants

' Boundary dependencies and coupling hotspots
ApiOrchestration <..[#D97706]> DatabaseClients : DatabaseSteps / RequestSpecs
ApiOrchestration <..[#D97706]> LifecycleSupport : registry / cleanup via ApiManager
ApiOrchestration ..[#7F8C8D,dashed]> DatabaseContracts : DBRequest / DAO
ApiOrchestration ..[#7F8C8D,dashed]> AssertionApi : verification
ApiOrchestration ..[#7F8C8D,dashed]> RuntimeConfiguration : settings / timeouts

ApiDataContracts ..[#D97706,dashed]> ModelDataGeneration : GeneratingRule metadata
ScenarioData ..[#D97706,dashed]> ApiDataContracts : status enums
LifecycleSupport ..[#7F8C8D,dashed]> ApiDataContracts : tracks concrete DTOs

TestConsumers ..[#7F8C8D,dashed]> ModelDataGeneration : generated models
TestConsumers ..[#7F8C8D,dashed]> ScenarioData : scenarios
TestConsumers ..[#7F8C8D,dashed]> LifecycleSupport : fixture teardown
TestConsumers ..[#7F8C8D,dashed]> TeamCityMetadata : locators
TestConsumers ..[#7F8C8D,dashed]> AllureMetadata : tags

' Stable overview layout: external layers, feature clusters, shared support.
ApiDataContracts -[hidden]right- ApiOrchestration
ApiOrchestration -[hidden]right- TestConsumers
ModelDataGeneration -[hidden]right- AssertionApi
AssertionApi -[hidden]right- LifecycleSupport
LifecycleSupport -[hidden]right- DatabaseClients
RuntimeConfiguration -[hidden]right- TeamCityMetadata
TeamCityMetadata -[hidden]right- AllureMetadata
AssertionApi -[hidden]down- RuntimeConfiguration

note bottom of CrossCutting
  All 30 owned classes are represented.
  Methods, fields, standard-library types and technology details are omitted.
end note

@enduml
